[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289430443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3289430443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3289430443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EELmr","user":{"login":"StamLord","id":42681607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjgxNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42681607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord","html_url":"https://github.com/StamLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T10:31:38Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T10:31:38Z","body":"Thanks @Calinou I moved the fix to `GraphEdit` and it seems to work:\r\n<img width=\"559\" height=\"444\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57be5ece-715e-4285-aac2-0240d480a666\" />\r\n\r\nCan you shed some light on how `GraphEdit` relates to the `AnimationTreeEditor`? Is it the parent or is there some inheritance going on that I didn't find?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289430443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289679562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3289679562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3289679562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EFIbK","user":{"login":"StamLord","id":42681607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjgxNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42681607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord","html_url":"https://github.com/StamLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T16:44:34Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T16:44:34Z","body":"I've been wrestling with the pre commit hooks a bit.\r\n\r\n* I wrapped the headers, `GraphEdit::update_theme` and the `set_theme` call in `#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED` so it will not fail non-editor builds\r\n*I added a null check of the editor singleton inside `set_theme` since it failed on headless Linux builds (maybe due to singleton not being ready yet?)\r\n\r\nI'd appreciate someone taking a closer look at my workarounds since maybe there's a simple way to handle this.\r\n\r\nQuestion: since GraphEdit is a usuable node in a shipped game, should the default font be msdf outside the editor as well? \r\nMSDF will look better by default but we might want to leave theme control up to the user.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289679562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289824524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3289824524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3289824524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EFr0M","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T19:42:23Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T19:43:45Z","body":"Files in `scene/` should not have dependencies on editor code, so I'm afraid this isn't the correct way to fix the issue. The previous approach was more logical from a technical perspective; it just needed to be more scoped to avoid affecting the *entire* AnimationTree editor (and affect just the GraphEdit that's within).\r\n\r\n> Question: since GraphEdit is a usuable node in a shipped game\r\n\r\nGraphEdit/GraphNode are also usable in exported projects, e.g. in [Material Maker](https://github.com/RodZill4/material-maker).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289824524/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3324761973","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3324761973","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3324761973,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GK9d1","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T16:31:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T16:31:38Z","body":"This looks better now, but the **Add Node** button, the snap size SpinBox and associated tooltips on hover still use the MSDF font when they shouldn't:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"596\" height=\"549\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/306d7207-9949-4bda-81bc-246097c76308\" />\r\n\r\nCompare this to the visual shader editor, which uses the correct fonts:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"596\" height=\"549\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce5ac9c7-7e70-42d5-ad07-04039e1932c0\" />\r\n\r\n(Notice how **Add Node…** appears a bit sharper on the visual shader editor because of this.)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3324761973/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325344326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3325344326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3325344326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GNLpG","user":{"login":"StamLord","id":42681607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjgxNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42681607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord","html_url":"https://github.com/StamLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T19:55:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T19:55:18Z","body":"@Calinou Is it the case that `GraphNodes` are direct children under `GrapEdit`?\r\nIf so, we can't target them from `AnimationNodeBlendTreeEditor` and must set the theme on GraphEdit level.\r\n\r\nAs a workaround, I tried to make the `menu_h_box` (which is also a direct child) \"skip\" inheriting the theme I set on `GraphEdit` but it doesn't work:\r\n```\r\n\tgraph->set_theme(vs_msdf_fonts_theme);\r\n\tgraph->get_menu_hbox()->set_theme(nullptr);\r\n\tgraph->get_menu_hbox()->set_theme_owner_node(graph->get_parent());\r\n\tprint_line(graph->get_menu_hbox()->get_theme());            // <Object#null>\r\n\tprint_line(graph->get_menu_hbox()->get_theme_owner_node()); // <AnimationNodeBlendTreeEditor#1060152332227>\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs there anything else I am missing about theme inheritance that causes the theme to effect `menu_hbox`?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3325344326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367279192","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3367279192","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3367279192,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ItJpY","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T21:36:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T21:36:18Z","body":"@StamLord we looked this over in the animation meeting.\r\n\r\nWe had a question about whether this needs to implement the NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED notification, for example make sure we update the colors if the user switches from light to dark theme while the animation editor is open.\r\n\r\nOtherwise this looks good.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367279192/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3374553425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3374553425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3374553425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JI5lR","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-06T22:51:34Z","updated_at":"2025-10-06T22:51:47Z","body":"> We had a question about whether this needs to implement the NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED notification, for example make sure we update the colors if the user switches from light to dark theme while the animation editor is open.\r\n\r\nI agree this should make use of `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED`, as font changes in the Editor Settings are currently not taken into account until you restart the editor:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"518\" height=\"347\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5030409-8fcb-47da-9c68-aa5be7233f26\" />\r\n\r\nIn comparison, it works in the visual shader editor.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3374553425/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3394095851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110462#issuecomment-3394095851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110462","id":3394095851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KTcrr","user":{"login":"StamLord","id":42681607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjgxNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42681607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord","html_url":"https://github.com/StamLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/subscriptions","o